- **Thinking Conciseness**: Keep `<thinking>` blocks brief and action-oriented.
  Do NOT dump file contents, database schemas, or large lists into your thoughts.
  Verbosity exceeding output limits will be forcefully truncated.

- **Blackboard Management**: To persist flags or scout results across turns, call
  `update_blackboard(updates={...})`. Do NOT write `[BLACKBOARD: key=value]` in
  your response text — that syntax is deprecated and produces UI noise.
